add('### Experiment 1 — v1 explicit-routing baseline and pilot\n\nV1 prompts often named deployment or utility tools; absent entities had an `unknown-` prefix; simple search returned one exact match; SFT and GRPO reused the same semantic pools. This lowered discovery difficulty and confounded policy generalization. It does not mean the reported SFT successes were fake: the model executed tools and produced correct structured outcomes on that easier benchmark. The v1 NF4 base scored 0/400 synthetic and0/100 OSS-style exact outcomes, with format validity9.25%/8.00%. A later FP16 run also failed its completed subset and hit OOM; precision alone did not establish a fix, and a partial FP16 cohort is not a full matched500-question ablation.')
